  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> DeckComponent.Initialize
    / DrawCard, HandComponent.AddCardAsync, DrunkardGame.Play / RestartGame.\n<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Scene workflow:</b> CardManager = DrunkardGame, DECK = DeckComponent, Hand
    Player / Hand Bot = HandComponent, Board = BoardComponent.\n<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Tap to play, click through the dealer's tips, then click
    your pile at the bottom: the higher card takes both, equal ranks start a war.\n<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color> 
    Your pile -> DrunkardGame.Play; score labels <- HandComponent.OnCardCountChanged
    -> SetText.\n<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color>  Bottom-right panel (after the tips):
    game events -> DemoLogFeed.Log, fixed shuffle seed + Restart deal."
